ert. <year>1970</year>. Fine structural changes in the <italic>Drosophila</italic> oocyte nucleus during a short period of RNA synthesis. <source>Wilhelm Roux' Archiv f&#x000fc;r Entwicklungsmechanik Der Organismen.</source> <volume>165</volume>:<fpage>8</fpage>&#x02013;25.</citation></ref><ref id="bib44"><citation citation-type="journal">Matera, A.G. <year>2003</year>. Cajal bodies. <source>Curr. Biol.</source> <volume>13</volume>:<fpage>R503</fpage>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12842022</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib45"><citation citation-type="journal">Matera, A.G., and D.C. Ward. <year>1993</year>. Nucleoplasmic organization of small nuclear ribonucleoproteins in cultured human cells. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>121</volume>:<fpage>715</fpage>&#x02013;727.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8491767</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib46"><citation citation-type="journal">Matera, A.G., and M.R. Frey. <year>1998</year>. Coiled bodies and gems: Janus or Gemini? <source>Am. J. Hum. Genet.</source> <volume>63</volume>:<fpage>317</fpage>&#x02013;321.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9683623</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib47"><citation citation-type="journal">Meister, G., and U. Fischer. <year>2002</year>. Assisted RNP assembly: SMN and PRMT5 complexes cooperate in the formation of spliceosomal UsnRNPs. <source>EMBO J.</source> <volume>21</volume>:<fpage>5853</fpage>&#x02013;5863.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12411503</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib48"><citation citation-type="journal">Nagai, T., K. Ibata, E.S. Park, M. Kubota, K. Mikoshiba, and A. Miyawaki. <year>2002</year>. A variant of yellow fluorescent protein with fast and efficient maturation for cell-biological applications. <source>Nat. Biotechnol.</source> <volume>20</volume>:<fpage>87</fpage>&#x02013;90.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11753368</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib49"><citation citation-type="journal">Ochs, R.L., M.A. Lischwe, W.H. Spohn, and H. Busch. <year>1985</year>. Fibrillarin: a 